RIDGE (PER-RADAR) PRODUCTS
==========================

URL TEMPLATE
------------
https://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/cache/tile.py/1.0.0/ridge::<RADAR>-<PRODUCT>-0/{z}/{x}/{y}.png

Replace <RADAR> with a radar ID such as:
KTLX
KDGX
KAMX
KLOT
KGRR
KBMX
KHGX
KMLB
etc.

AVAILABLE PRODUCTS
------------------

N0Q
Digital Base Reflectivity

N0R
Legacy Base Reflectivity

N0U
Base Velocity

N0S
Storm Relative Velocity

NSW
