NOT AVAILABLE AS NATIONWIDE CACHE/TILE.PY LAYERS
================================================

These are ONLY available through the RIDGE per-radar URLs:

- Base Velocity
- Storm Relative Velocity
- Spectrum Width
- Differential Reflectivity (ZDR)
- Correlation Coefficient (CC)
- Specific Differential Phase (KDP)
- Differential Phase (PhiDP)
- Hydrometeor Classification (HCA)

They cannot be accessed using:

https://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/cache/tile.py/1.0.0/nexrad-...

because they are radar-specific products.
